{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18754","headline":"养鸷词 · 刘禹锡","name":"养鸷词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养鸷非玩形，所资击鲜力。\n少年昧其理，日日哺不息。\n探雏网黄口，旦暮有余食。\n宁知下韝时，翅重飞不得。\n毰毸止林表，狡兔自南北。\n饮啄既已盈，安能劳羽翼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}